source .venv/bin/activate
psql -d postgres / ai_news
python run_pipeline.py
streamlit run app.py

Schedule (every 6 hours)
------------------------
Run in its own terminal and leave it open:

    python -m pipeline.scheduler

It runs the pipeline immediately, then every 6 hours. If the Mac
sleeps through a run, it runs as soon as the Mac wakes. Ctrl+C
stops it; it doesn't survive closing the terminal, logout, or a
restart, so start it again after those.

To run it in the background instead and keep a log:

    nohup python -m pipeline.scheduler >> scheduler.log 2>&1 &

Stop it with: pkill -f pipeline.scheduler

Only run one scheduler at a time.
